<meta name="description" content="Share your knowledge and define the next steps for Research Data Management community!The EUDAT Conference 2026 is heading to Prague from 25-27 November, 2026. As the flagshp event for EUDAT Conference, this event gathers researchers, data managers, service providers to discuss the latest advancements and best practices in open science, as well as the wider research data management community." />
